    "text": "This fact is true for any quadratic polynomial, i.e., the zeroes of a quadratic\npolynomial ax2 + bx + c, a  0, are precisely the x-coordinates of the points where the\nparabola representing  y = ax2 + bx + c intersects the x-axis.",
